                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/3830: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-10-10T19:00:00-05:00">October 10, 1933—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>117. At the press conference this morning the Under Secretary reiterated the
                    third, fourth and fifth sentences of the statement communicated to you by
                    telegram 96, September 11.<anchor n="64" xml:id="d442-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
